Subject: [PATCH 12/14] perf(llm): count prompt/completion/thinking tokens in
 worker pool at stream end

_logEnd ran at the end of every stream and tokenized the full prompt,
completion and thinking text synchronously in pure JS on the extension
host main thread - for reasoning models the thinking text alone reaches
tens of thousands of tokens, which froze VS Code right when the reply
finished. The counts now run in the tokenizer worker pool in parallel,
falling back to the sync counter only if the pool fails.
